{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 23,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 442.108,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Alma, having been warned of the Lord that the armies of king Noah would come upon them,",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.567,
      "end": 7.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having made it known to his people,",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.162,
      "end": 10.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they gathered together their flocks,",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.989,
      "end": 12.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took of their grain,",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.934,
      "end": 16.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and departed into the wilderness before the armies of king Noah.",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.561,
      "end": 19.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord did strengthen them,",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.831,
      "end": 24.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the people of king Noah could not overtake them to destroy them.",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.201,
      "end": 28.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they fled eight days' journey into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "23:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.9,
      "end": 35.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they came to a land, yea, even a very beautiful and pleasant land, a land of pure water.",
      "verse": "23:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.035,
      "end": 37.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they pitched their tents,",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.026,
      "end": 40.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to till the ground,",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 40.389,
      "end": 42.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to build buildings;",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.705,
      "end": 46.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they were industrious, and did labor exceedingly.",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.775,
      "end": 50.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people were desirous that Alma should be their king,",
      "verse": "23:6",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.81,
      "end": 53.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he was beloved by his people.",
      "verse": "23:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.905,
      "end": 55.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But he said unto them:",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 55.803,
      "end": 58.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it is not expedient that we should have a king;",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.094,
      "end": 60.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 60.992,
      "end": 63.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye shall not esteem one flesh above another,",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.098,
      "end": 67.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or one man shall not think himself above another;",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.297,
      "end": 68.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I say unto you",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.102,
      "end": 71.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it is not expedient that ye should have a king.",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.29,
      "end": 77.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, if it were possible that ye could always have just men to be your kings",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 77.3,
      "end": 79.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it would be well for you to have a king.",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 80.441,
      "end": 83.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But remember the iniquity of king Noah and his priests;",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 84.15,
      "end": 86.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I myself was caught in a snare,",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 86.606,
      "end": 90.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did many things which were abominable in the sight of the Lord,",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 90.919,
      "end": 93.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which caused me sore repentance;",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 93.828,
      "end": 96.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, after much tribulation,",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 96.702,
      "end": 98.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord did hear my cries,",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 98.879,
      "end": 100.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did answer my prayers,",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 100.917,
      "end": 106.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has made me an instrument in his hands in bringing so many of you to a knowledge of his truth.",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 107.541,
      "end": 109.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, in this I do not glory,",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 110.043,
      "end": 112.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I am unworthy to glory of myself.",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 113.184,
      "end": 114.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I say unto you,",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 114.989,
      "end": 117.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have been oppressed by king Noah,",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 117.352,
      "end": 119.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been in bondage to him and his priests,",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 120.04,
      "end": 123.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been brought into iniquity by them;",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 123.192,
      "end": 126.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore ye were bound with the bands of iniquity.",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 126.844,
      "end": 131.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now as ye have been delivered by the power of God out of these bonds;",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 131.25,
      "end": 134.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even out of the hands of king Noah and his people,",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 134.913,
      "end": 137.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also from the bonds of iniquity,",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 137.508,
      "end": 141.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I desire that ye should stand fast in this liberty",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 141.357,
      "end": 143.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherewith ye have been made free,",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 143.487,
      "end": 146.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye trust no man to be a king over you.",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 147.093,
      "end": 150.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also trust no one to be your teacher nor your minister,",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 150.802,
      "end": 152.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except he be a man of God,",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 152.932,
      "end": 156.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "walking in his ways and keeping his commandments.",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 156.77,
      "end": 158.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus did Alma teach his people,",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 159.086,
      "end": 162.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that every man should love his neighbor as himself,",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 162.238,
      "end": 165.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there should be no contention among them.",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 166.215,
      "end": 168.537,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Alma was their high priest,",
      "verse": "23:16",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 168.717,
      "end": 171.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being the founder of their church.",
      "verse": "23:16",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 172.183,
      "end": 176.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that none received authority to preach or to teach",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 176.775,
      "end": 179.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were by him from God.",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 179.277,
      "end": 183.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore he consecrated all their priests and all their teachers;",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 183.822,
      "end": 187.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none were consecrated except they were just men.",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 187.892,
      "end": 190.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they did watch over their people,",
      "verse": "23:18",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 190.58,
      "end": 194.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did nourish them with things pertaining to righteousness.",
      "verse": "23:18",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 194.929,
      "end": 199.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they began to prosper exceedingly in the land;",
      "verse": "23:19",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 199.939,
      "end": 201.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they called the land Helam.",
      "verse": "23:19",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 202.523,
      "end": 208.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did multiply and prosper exceedingly in the land of Helam;",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 208.276,
      "end": 209.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they built a city,",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 210.174,
      "end": 212.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they called the city of Helam.",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 213.408,
      "end": 216.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless the Lord seeth fit to chasten his people;",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 216.932,
      "end": 219.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he trieth their patience and their faith.",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 220.213,
      "end": 223.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless\u2014whosoever putteth his trust in him",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 223.783,
      "end": 226.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same shall be lifted up at the last day.",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 226.564,
      "end": 228.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and thus it was with this people.",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 229.566,
      "end": 231.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I will show unto you",
      "verse": "23:23",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 232.068,
      "end": 234.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were brought into bondage,",
      "verse": "23:23",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 234.245,
      "end": 241.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none could deliver them but the Lord their God, yea, even the God of Abraham and Isaac and of Jacob.",
      "verse": "23:23",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 242.03,
      "end": 245.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he did deliver them,",
      "verse": "23:24",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 245.321,
      "end": 248.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did show forth his mighty power unto them,",
      "verse": "23:24",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 248.612,
      "end": 250.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great were their rejoicings.",
      "verse": "23:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 251.242,
      "end": 255.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it came to pass that while they were in the land of Helam,",
      "verse": "23:25",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 255.741,
      "end": 259.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in the city of Helam, while tilling the land round about,",
      "verse": "23:25",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 259.868,
      "end": 264.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold an army of the Lamanites was in the borders of the land.",
      "verse": "23:25",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 264.728,
      "end": 269.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that the brethren of Alma fled from their fields,",
      "verse": "23:26",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 269.413,
      "end": 272.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gathered themselves together in the city of Helam;",
      "verse": "23:26",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 272.704,
      "end": 278.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were much frightened because of the appearance of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "23:26",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 279.05,
      "end": 281.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Alma went forth and stood among them,",
      "verse": "23:27",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 281.784,
      "end": 284.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and exhorted them that they should not be frightened,",
      "verse": "23:27",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 284.89,
      "end": 289.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they should remember the Lord their God and he would deliver them.",
      "verse": "23:27",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 290.168,
      "end": 292.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they hushed their fears,",
      "verse": "23:28",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 292.809,
      "end": 295.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to cry unto the Lord",
      "verse": "23:28",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 295.357,
      "end": 298.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would soften the hearts of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "23:28",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 298.648,
      "end": 300.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would spare them,",
      "verse": "23:28",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 300.5,
      "end": 302.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wives, and their children.",
      "verse": "23:28",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 303.595,
      "end": 307.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord did soften the hearts of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "23:29",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 308.001,
      "end": 310.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma and his brethren went forth",
      "verse": "23:29",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 310.689,
      "end": 313.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and delivered themselves up into their hands;",
      "verse": "23:29",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 313.702,
      "end": 317.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites took possession of the land of Helam.",
      "verse": "23:29",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 317.911,
      "end": 320.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the armies of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "23:30",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 320.227,
      "end": 323.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had followed after the people of king Limhi,",
      "verse": "23:30",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 323.704,
      "end": 326.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had been lost in the wilderness for many days.",
      "verse": "23:30",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 327.124,
      "end": 333.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, they had found those priests of king Noah, in a place which they called Amulon;",
      "verse": "23:31",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 333.573,
      "end": 337.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had begun to possess the land of Amulon",
      "verse": "23:31",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 337.19,
      "end": 339.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had begun to till the ground.",
      "verse": "23:31",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 339.96,
      "end": 343.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the name of the leader of those priests was Amulon.",
      "verse": "23:32",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 343.751,
      "end": 347.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amulon did plead with the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "23:33",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 347.46,
      "end": 349.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also sent forth their wives,",
      "verse": "23:33",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 349.637,
      "end": 352.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were the daughters of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "23:33",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 352.65,
      "end": 354.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to plead with their brethren,",
      "verse": "23:33",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 354.734,
      "end": 357.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should not destroy their husbands.",
      "verse": "23:33",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 357.736,
      "end": 361.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lamanites had compassion on Amulon and his brethren,",
      "verse": "23:34",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 362.003,
      "end": 365.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did not destroy them, because of their wives.",
      "verse": "23:34",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 365.702,
      "end": 368.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Amulon and his brethren did join the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "23:35",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 369.133,
      "end": 374.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were traveling in the wilderness in search of the land of Nephi",
      "verse": "23:35",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 375.164,
      "end": 377.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they discovered the land of Helam,",
      "verse": "23:35",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 377.666,
      "end": 380.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was possessed by Alma and his brethren.",
      "verse": "23:35",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 381.272,
      "end": 392.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites promised unto Alma and his brethren, that if they would show them the way which led to the land of Nephi",
      "verse": "23:36",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 393.062,
      "end": 396.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would grant unto them their lives and their liberty.",
      "verse": "23:36",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 397.457,
      "end": 401.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But after Alma had shown them the way that led to the land of Nephi",
      "verse": "23:37",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 401.631,
      "end": 403.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites would not keep their promise;",
      "verse": "23:37",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 404.133,
      "end": 409.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they set guards round about the land of Helam, over Alma and his brethren.",
      "verse": "23:37",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 409.782,
      "end": 412.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the remainder of them went to the land of Nephi;",
      "verse": "23:38",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 413.12,
      "end": 416.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a part of them returned to the land of Helam,",
      "verse": "23:38",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 416.458,
      "end": 420.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also brought with them the wives and the children of the guards",
      "verse": "23:38",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 421.096,
      "end": 423.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been left in the land.",
      "verse": "23:38",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 424.562,
      "end": 428.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king of the Lamanites had granted unto Amulon",
      "verse": "23:39",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 428.225,
      "end": 431.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should be a king and a ruler over his people,",
      "verse": "23:39",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 431.609,
      "end": 434.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were in the land of Helam;",
      "verse": "23:39",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 434.343,
      "end": 437.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless he should have no power to do anything",
      "verse": "23:39",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 437.634,
      "end": 441.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "contrary to the will of the king of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "23:39",
      "lineIndex": 127
    }
  ]
}